# OZONE world - Sektor_03_AegisBaseAlpha
# Sefirah 1 - Terran Prime. A rogue portal research base.
#
# INTENT
#   Fantasy: a base that lost control of something and kept building. The
#   hangar still has the empty cradle; the machine itself was moved north,
#   behind two more checkpoints.
#   One moment: the hangar doors part on an EMPTY portal frame - the dais,
#   the pylons, no field - and you realise the thing is deeper in.
#
#   Pacing arc:
#     0:00  READ       gate yard, hangar doors ahead, crates for cover
#     0:40  PRESSURE   yard crossfire from three angles
#     1:40  OPTIONAL   barracks (pistol), armoury (rifle), watchtower
#     2:40  STORY      hangar: the empty frame, the crane, the cradles
#     3:30  GATE       north gate -> motor pool
#     4:30  PRESSURE   apron: fuel island, vehicle bay, two bunkers
#     5:30  CLIMB      bunker roofs: an angle on the whole apron
#     6:30  CLIMAX     containment annex: cells, gallery, the rig
#     7:30  RESOLUTION walk into the machine
#
#   Flow:  south gate -> yard -> hangar (empty frame) -> north gate
#                         |-> barracks   |-> armoury   |-> watchtower
#                      -> motor pool -> bunker roofs (optional)
#                      -> annex -> gallery / cells -> rig -> EXIT
#
#   Two routes through the annex: the hall floor straight at the rig, or the
#   control gallery (8 up) that overlooks it. The gallery is the safer read
#   and the cells hold the loot, so the floor route is a choice.
#
# GEOMETRY NOTES
#   Yard, apron and annex all z=0. Hangar ceiling 10, annex ceiling 14,
#   gallery 8, bunkers 6. Every doorway 6+ tall, every tread 1.0.
#
# Format: ozone v1.0  (Z-up: x=east, y=north, z=up)

# ============================================================================
# Geometry
# ============================================================================
# ==========================================================================
# DISTRICT A - the compound: yard, hangar, barracks, armoury, tower.
# ==========================================================================
