#
#
#
# Spawn: just inside the south gate, facing the hangar doors 45 units up
# the yard. The yard's cover is laid out either side of that sightline.
# --- pickups ---
# --- district B and C ---
#
# --- patrol graph ---
# The tower top is its own loop: street nodes must not link upstairs.
#
# District B, apron loop.
# Bunker roof: its own loop.
#
# District C, hall and gallery loops.
#
# --- encounters ---
# A. E1 yard: three read from the gate, crates and the truck between them.
# A. E2 hangar: the empty frame is guarded.
# A. E3 side rooms and the tower.
#
# B. E4 apron: two on the floor, one holding the fuel island.
# B. E5 bunker roof and vehicle bay.
#
# C. E6 annex: the rig is held, the gallery overlooks it.
# C. E7 containment cells: one each, so the loot costs a fight.
#
# --- light ---
# Yard floods on the four corners of the parade ground.
# Hangar interior: high cold strip lights.
# The empty cradle keeps its light: it is still switched on.
# Side rooms and tower.
#
# B. Apron: four masts and the fuel island.
# C. Annex: the rig is the key light.
#
# --- routing ---
# Exit: the aperture of the annex rig. Spawn is KryoArchipel's origin,
# which is open ice there.

